<body>

<h1>Daily Progress Report: Expert Professionals Website</h1>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> September 17, 2026</p>
<p>This document summarizes all the development, design, and content updates completed today to elevate the webpage into a premium platform for experts.</p>

<h2>1. User Interface (UI) &amp; Interaction Enhancements</h2>
<ul>
    <li><span class="highlight">Advanced Hover Interactions:</span> Completely rebuilt the hover effect on the "Solutions" cards. The main description now smoothly fades out while the 3 key bullet points fade in, maximizing space and interactivity without expanding the card awkwardly.</li>
    <li><span class="highlight">Clean &amp; Minimalist Design:</span> Removed all redundant icons/logos from the Solutions, Benefits (TheNeed), and Features (Trust) sections. This created a much cleaner, highly professional text-focused layout.</li>
    <li><span class="highlight">Sizing &amp; Layout Adjustments:</span> 
        <ul>
            <li>Increased the width of the FAQ accordion to make it more readable on desktop.</li>
            <li>Increased the minimum height and padding of the Workflow and Features boxes to give them a stronger visual presence.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><span class="highlight">Color Corrections:</span> Refined the FAQ section by switching it to a crisp light theme (white cards with gray borders) and removed unwanted blue hover colors from the text to maintain brand consistency.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Content &amp; Copywriting Strategy</h2>
<ul>
    <li><span class="highlight">Expert-Focused Copy:</span> Shifted the entire tone of the website to cater specifically to high-level professionals (Doctors, Lawyers, Financial Advisors). Replaced "Consultants &amp; Coaches" with "Artists &amp; Creatives".</li>
    <li><span class="highlight">FAQ Overhaul:</span> Rewrote the frequently asked questions to address the specific pain points of busy experts (e.g., "How much of my time will this take?", "What makes you different from a standard agency?").</li>
    <li><span class="highlight">Eliminated Repetition:</span> Identified that the "Benefits" section and "Trust" section were repeating the same concepts. Rewrote the dark "Trust" section to exclusively focus on concrete deliverables: <em>Bespoke Branding, Built-In SEO, and Managed Hosting &amp; Support</em>.</li>
    <li><span class="highlight">Stronger Call-to-Action:</span> Updated the Final CTA text to be more persuasive ("Ready to elevate your professional practice? Let's build a digital presence that works just as hard as you do.").</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Technical Components Modified</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Solutions.jsx:</strong> Hover effects and icon removal.</li>
    <li><strong>TheNeed.jsx:</strong> Text updates and layout cleaning.</li>
    <li><strong>FAQ.jsx:</strong> New Q&amp;A data, width adjustments, and color theme changes.</li>
    <li><strong>Trust.jsx:</strong> Complete content pivot to "Platform Features", increased box sizes, and icon removal.</li>
    <li><strong>FinalCTA.jsx:</strong> Headline and subheadline copywriting updates.</li>
</ul>

<p><em>Conclusion: The webpage is now structurally sound, conceptually distinct across all sections, and visually tailored for a premium audience.</em></p>

</body>
</html>
